      "comment": "HOTTIE DAVIES (2) is a well performed dog and winner of seven races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at this track (18.68). Form from her last run is proving strong. Should be very hard to beat this time. ASADO (4) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at Temora in a handy 18.83 beating Flying Gecko. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. PAW RENALLA (7) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at Temora over 330m behind Winning Hand (19.89) in a Grade 5. The form out of last race has been strong. Can figure in the finish. QUARTIC FUNCTION (1) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
